# A smaller beam accepts a wider range of angles, hence of wavelengths: the 1 dB width scales as 1 / MFD.
# Reference: numerical spectrum, and the Gaussian-beam formula within 3%.
title Apodised grating and a 15 um fibre: bandwidth
grating angle=10 length=45
leak 1.5
apodise gaussian
fibre mfd=15.0
sweep 1.42 1.68 521
expect peak_wavelength 1.55000000 0.0002
expect bandwidth_1db 28.64854882 0.004
expect bandwidth_3db 49.71851394 0.004
expect bandwidth_formula 0.03
